            the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Grothendieck+topos"} Grothendieck topos
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category+of+sheaves"} sheaves
            on
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi X
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X
          %p
            We discuss the internal logic of this sheaf topos (originally
            = succeed ")." do
              %a{:href => "#Tarski"} Tarski, 1938
          %p
            The
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/terminal+object"} terminal object
            is the sheaf
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/representable+functor"} represented by
            = succeed ":" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi X
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X
